    A->>Z: report.yaml + specs
    Z->>I: one zip / un zip
    I->>V: draft, validated
    V->>V: apply: checks again, composes
    B->>Api: period, compare, filters
    Api->>E: context + selection hash
    E->>W: one aggregation per view and period
    W-->>E: rows
    E-->>Api: payload (views, freshness)
    Api-->>B: JSON + ETag
